ed_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8jXmNMrGJ2acUG1R-D5e6w","review_id":"wX1TVO9R_JVOa4xt05igVw","date":"2014-02-13T18:08:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.953662633895874,"text_excerpt":"We're in from Kentucky and a friend recommended Dat Dog. When we got out of the cab, the place looked like it would be good - sometimes street appeal gives you a good vibe. The place is fun and cool inside. We sat at the bar for lunch and the bartender was very friendly and helpful. My wife had a blueberry shake and I got a chocolate malt - both delicious. She got the hot sausage \"Chicago style\" and it was great. Based on a Yelp review, I got tve Crawfish Etouffe Dog and it was awesome! Our only regret was ordering fries as it was too much food, so most of them were wasted. This is a great place with a variety of gourmet dogs & sausages. If we're back in NOLA, we'll go back to Dat Dog!!"},{"business_id":"8jXmNMrGJ2acUG1R-D5e6w","review_id":"D8PSDoazlZMcWGb-ExE-0w","date":"2018-02-05T22:11:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9462577700614929,"text_excerpt":"We live nearby to dat dog so we eat here quite frequently. They have a good selection of different flavors of sausages and other things that fit in a hot dog bun to satisfy any craving you have. They have a long list of toppings and don't limit you, meaning you can add as many as you want. The buns that they come in are soft and toasted and I could honestly just eat those by myself. My personal favorite is the classic dat chick which is actually fried chicken in a bun with coleslaw, chick sauce, and jalapeños. Their cheddar bacon ranch fries are also a great choice to go with any sausage. The prices are slightly higher but they do have a rewards program- I just got a free day dog for my b..."},{"business_id":"8jXmNMrGJ2acUG1R-D5e6w","review_id":"gyXXd6YPEjM4a1BIQL1ljg","date":"2016-03-18T19:21:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.945275068283081,"text_excerpt":"I can go and on about how great Dat Dog is. Service can sometimes be a little slow, but the amazing dogs and fries make up for it. Anything from the slovenian dog to the crawfish dog is incredibly delicious, and there aren't many places outside of NOLA that have food as unique as this. My personal favorite sausage that you can't go wrong with is the gator sausage. Also, I recommend ordering them chef's choice because they always think of some unique and delicious combination of toppings that go with the actual dog. Fries wise, I'd go with the bacon cheddar ranch or the white trash fries. This place is also very cheap and fun so bring along people visiting you from out of town because ever..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8jXmNMrGJ2acUG1R-D5e6w","photo_id":"G_SDIwwEW47ZEjlf9ClbJg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/G_SDIwwEW47ZEjlf9ClbJg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8350892066955566},{"business_id":"8jXmNMrGJ2acUG1R-D5e6w","photo_id":"4ezPIYpSU9_J7K3bFch7wQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4ezPIYpSU9_J7K3bFch7wQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8291999101638794},{"business_id":"8jXmNMrGJ2acUG1R-D5e6w","photo_id":"1FYw3_bxLmdc-Fl3jif-rg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1FYw3_bxLmdc-Fl3jif-rg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8238560557365417},{"business_id":"8jXmNMrGJ2acUG1R-D5e6w","photo_id":"fhIT8dtvp2OQCc4lVC5Seg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/fhIT8dtvp2OQCc4lVC5Seg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8070403337478638},{"business_id":"8jXmNMrGJ2acUG1R-D5e6w","photo_id":"Na2lGirMKZ0HXMKTgdfIqw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Na2lGirMKZ0HXMKTgdfIqw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7762629389762878}]},"notebook_case":null}
